    "C": "(a) $\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$; (b) $\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$; (c) $x=2L$",
    "D": "(a) $\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$; (b) $\\alpha=\\pi$; (c) $x=\\frac{L}{2}$"
